"""
Persistent Memory Filter for OpenWebUI — family edition (v4.1)
Single-file Filter with inlet (recall/commands/aliases) + outlet (store).

v4.1 changes (7 features):
  1. Dynamic full-detail tags (DB-backed config, memory tag full/unfull/list commands)
  2. Two-tier recall (index entries for broad queries, full text for strong matches)
  3. Same-conversation dedup (skip memories from current chat during auto-recall)
  4. Recall frequency boosting (use_count × 0.01 added to effective score)
  5. Time-decay for non-reference, non-pinned memories (-0.10 per 30-day half-life)
  6. Obsidian vault subfolders (conversations/ for chat, <tag>/ for tagged knowledge)
  7. memory get: <id|description> command + storage confirmation with memory ID

Requirements:
  - sentence-transformers (pip install sentence-transformers)
  - numpy (pip install numpy)
  - An embedding model (default: BAAI/bge-m3, 1024-dim)

Environment Variables (all optional, defaults shown):
  MEMORY_BASE_PATH=/app/backend/data
  MEMORY_DB_PATH=<BASE_PATH>/memories.db
  MEMORY_VAULT_DIR=<BASE_PATH>/ObsidianVault/Memories
  MEMORY_EMBED_MODEL=BAAI/bge-m3
  MEMORY_EMBED_DIM=1024
"""

